  "notes": "### Fixed\n- **Each phone keeps its own \"Call me by\" name** — the name, standing instructions and swearing setting on Mimir Mobile's Identity screen now belong to the phone that saved them, so two phones signed in to the same Tailscale account, or two people sharing one, each keep the name they set. A phone message in a desktop chat, and in other phones' chats, now shows that phone's chosen name. A phone that has not saved one yet starts from what it had before.",
